            "step_3_title": "Feel the cold",
            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Experience professional facial rejuvenation at home with the GLAM facial cupping system. Featuring precisely designed cups for every facial contour, this comprehensive set combines ancient beauty secrets with modern innovation for natural, visible lifting and sculpting results.\n\nYour Professional Set includes specially engineered cups for face, eyes, nose, and lips, complete with a convenient storage/travel bag. Each cup is designed for specific facial zones - from broad areas like cheeks and forehead to delicate regions around eyes and lips. The innovative designs ensure gentle yet effective treatment for all skin types, delivering spa-level facial rejuvenation in the comfort of home.\n\nGLAM cups anti-slip design promotes natural lifting and toning, reduces facial puffiness, and encourages lymphatic drainage. The gentle suction helps release muscle tension to soften fine lines, minimize pores, and activate collagen production naturally. Perfect for defining jawlines, plumping lips, lifting eyebrows, and revitalizing tired eyes. Regular use helps achieve and maintain a naturally sculpted, youthful appearance."
          }
        },
