            "step_1_title": "Tear open",
            "step_1_description": "a sealed mask — no prep",
            "step_2_title": "Loop it on",
            "step_2_description": "— ear loops keep it in place",
            "step_3_title": "Feel the cold",
            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Dynamic (Gliding) Technique: Apply facial oil or serum for smooth frictionless glide. Keep cups moving continuously in outward motions along facial contours, draining toward lymph nodes. Never leave cups \"parked\" on facial skin to avoid marking. Perfect for lifting, toning, and encouraging lymphatic drainage.\n\nEye Area Technique: Use smallest eye cup only for the delicate eye area. Apply very gentle suction-release movements - no gliding or dragging. This light pumping action helps reduce puffiness and refresh tired eyes.\n\nImportant: Always use on clean skin and keep cups in constant motion. Never leave cups stationary on facial skin. Use extremely gentle pressure - facial tissue requires a delicate touch. Can be incorporated into your daily skincare routine. For complete facial mapping, lymphatic drainage pathways, and specific techniques for each facial zone, please refer to the detailed guide included with your set."
          }
